ness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 04-23-2018, 07:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T16:35:55-07:00","id":1210675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1210255-what-if-overwatch-blizzard-canon?p=1210673#post1210673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd go that route for Zenyatta as well, to be fair.<br /> <br /> Bastion probably too, if one with some GM hidden programming it needs to deal with, but for Orisa I'd pick the easy route and make her a Promethean<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, for reasons I can't exactly explain, the idea of Brigitte as a Created made by Torbjorn that takes on knightly themes for her Pilgrimage seems quite cool to me. Plus Pharah as an Ugallu Nemesis</div> </div> </div> </div>Bastion's themes are all Promethean, though.<br /> <br /> Zenyatta's...hard to pin. He's somewhere between Mage and Promethean.<br /> <br /> Brigitte is all Obrimos. As for Pharah....<br /> <br /> Well. Justice rains from above. Good thing I brought an umbrella.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/