</div> </div>Hard to not argue Reinhardt as an Obrimos as well, particularly as an Arrow, or an Elodoth Talon. Torb....No idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T17:13:05-07:00","id":1210687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1210255-what-if-overwatch-blizzard-canon?p=1210599#post1210599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Likes aside, gotta give you credit for always coming up with creative and unexpected translations from one setting to the CotD, Leliel. Kudos, really.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Aw, thanks.<br /> <br /> Torb is obviously a Wizened. No matter how he got his powers, he's a Wizened. That much Dwarf in one place turned him into a Wizened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T19:10:55-07:00","id":1210747,"title":"","content":"Also, some of the hero Heroes:<br /> <br /> Soldier: 76: A member of VALKYRIE's successor (his genetic treatments weren't enough to push him beyond human - another reason Reaper resents him to no end), turned Pariah, turned &quot;solo operator&quot; (big Swiss quotation marks around that phrase - he gets his tech <i>somewhere</i>).<br /> <br /> Jesse McCree: Tempted to make him a Blood Talon after all the fan-concept of him being a werewolf, but I'll go with his lack of any wolf-theming and make him an Inguma Predator who leans a bit into the Ugallu part of his family (&quot;It's high noon&quot; may as well be his hunting cry, the last thing his prey ever hears before feeling the bullets impact).<br /> <br /> Mercy: An Obrimos Libertine, actually, though she's a specialist in Life magic. She's all about Techne and turning magical theory into nanotech fact. Which implies that in the CofD, she really <i>is</i> a mad scientist who has a complicated time with ethics,<i> and</i> a genuinely good person. Mages be complicated, yo.<br /> <br /> The Shimada Bros: Lineage of Offspring or possibly Proximi; Hanzo relies on his abilities and archery exclusively, while Genji was saved by Mercy hacking the God-Machine's own medical tech to catch his soul before it left his body (as shown in his Blackwatch skin, his mods aren't actually all that extensive).<br /> <br /> Mei: <s>The First Unchained Herself come to wreck vengeance upon the world</s> A Lion-Headed Arisen who's gone seriously native, to the point where it's not obvious what her Guild is; she does not care about the Judges any more. Snowball is actually her faithful Sadikh's brain inna jar inna cute exterior.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T19:47:11-07:00","id":1210769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1210255-what-if-overwatch-blizzard-canon?p=1210747#post1210747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mei: <s>The First Unchained Herself come to wreck vengeance upon the world</s> <s>A Lion-Headed Arisen who's gone seriously native, to the point where it's not obvious what her Guild is; she does not care about the Judges any more. Snowball is actually her faithful Sadikh's brain inna jar inna cute exterior.</s> The Adversary from Inferno.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed that for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachmen